{#
  How far the account is known, for « Rapprocher un virement » (#980,
  chantier §2.6): a credit is found only once the statement carrying it
  has been imported into Finances. With no statement imported since the
  search starts, the dialog and an empty search say so; otherwise the
  date of the last import, so an empty list is read for what it is.

  Requires `transfer_since` and `transfer_statement_at` (or null: none
  ever imported, or nothing to say it).
#}
{% if transfer_statement_at is null or transfer_statement_at < transfer_since %}
    <p class="alert alert-warning small" data-transfer-no-statement>
        Aucun extrait importé depuis le {{ transfer_since|date_fr }} : un virement reçu depuis n'apparaît
        qu'après l'import, dans les Finances, de l'extrait bancaire qui le contient.
    </p>
{% else %}
    <p class="small text-body-secondary" data-transfer-statement>
        Dernier extrait bancaire importé le {{ transfer_statement_at|date_fr }} : un virement reçu après
        n'apparaît pas encore.
    </p>
{% endif %}
